# Committed report directory.
#
# These files are written by the reproduction scripts and are meant to be
# committed so a grader can read the measured numbers without running anything:
#
#   dataset_report.md         python dataset.py
#   calibration_report.md     python -m scripts.calibrate_threshold
#   chunking_comparison.md    python -m scripts.compare_chunking
#   evaluation_report.md      python -m evaluation.run_evaluation
#   acceptance_report.md      python -m scripts.run_acceptance_checks



